# Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan: "Whenever you cast a spell that targets a creature you control, draw a card. Until end of turn,
# Ms. Marvel gains 'Ms. Marvel's base power is equal to the number of cards in your hand.'" Bot1 bolts her own Ms. Marvel on
# turn 3 (she is a 1/4 and lives): the trigger resolves above the Bolt, Bot1 draws (CR 603.3b), and the static ability she has
# been given (CR 613.1f) sets her base power to Bot1's hand live (CR 611.3a, 613.4b): two cards after the draw, four after
# Ancestral Recall has left the hand and drawn three, three once a Mox Pearl is cast for {0}. Toughness stays 4, and on
# Bot2's turn the effect is over (CR 514.2): she is a 1/4 again.

